   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IAM302 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 8 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14339 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IAM302 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>8 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14339 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Develop a good understanding of Malware Analysis: today’s greatly increasing malware threats, malware activity mechanism and behavior, malware classification, building an environment to do static and dynamic malware analysis, methods and tools to detect, analyze, reverse-engineer, and eradicate malware.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Identify the different types of Malware Analysis methods: static (ASCII, binary, logical signature detection), dynamic (network traffic analysis, memory forensics, dynamic reverse engineering) and hybrid.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Gain a broad exposure to real world applications of Malware Analysis: take control of the incident, incident response, analyze the threat, examine interactions with the environment, mitigate the risks of malware attempting to escape from the lab,</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Set up a relatively inexpensive lab for Malware Analysis activities.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Utilize a standard methodology for detecting, analyzing, reverse engineering, and eradicating malware.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Use a Malware Analysis-based approach in order to resolve real world problems.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Recognize common malware characteristics: propagation, infection, self-defense, capabilities, …</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Bypass some of the advanced malware techniques, such as packing, obfuscation and anti-analysis of armored malware breeds.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14339\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14339</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14339\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14339</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
